%3$s','This review link is not valid any more. Ask for a new one.'=>'此评价链接已失效。请索取新链接。','Too many comments from this link in the last hour. Try again later.'=>'最近一小时内来自此链接的评论过多。请稍后重试。','Your role cannot create templates or patterns.'=>'您的角色无法创建模板或模式。','You can change the text and images on this page, but not its layout or design. Your change was not saved.'=>'您可以在此页面上更改文字和图片，但无法更改其布局或设计。您的更改未保存。','Your role cannot change styles. Undo the style changes and save again.'=>'您的角色无法更改样式。请撤消样式更改并再次保存。','Your role cannot add or change custom code (custom CSS or HTML blocks). Undo those changes and save again.'=>'您的角色无法添加或更改自定义代码（自定义 CSS 或 HTML 块）。请撤消这些更改并重新保存。','This is not an export file from this plugin.'=>'这不是此插件的导出文件。','This export file was made by a newer version of the plugin. Update the plugin on this site, then import it again.'=>'此导出文件是由该插件的更新版本生成的。请更新本网站上的插件，然后再次导入。','The export file is damaged: its list of items is missing.'=>'导出的文件已损坏：缺少其项目列表。','The export file is damaged or was edited after it was made (its checksum does not match). Export it again from the other site.'=>'导出文件已损坏或在创建后经过修改（其校验和不匹配）。请从另一个站点重新导出。','“%s” was not imported: this site does not have that kind of item.'=>'“%s”未能导入：此站点没有该类项目。','“%s” was not imported: you are not allowed to create that kind of item.'=>'“%s”未导入：您无权创建该类型的项目。','“%s” was not replaced: you are not allowed to edit the one on this site.'=>'“%s” 未被替换：您无权编辑此网站上的该项。','“%1$s” was not imported: %2$s'=>'“%1$s”未导入：%2$s','Settings were not imported: only an administrator can change them.'=>'未能导入设置：只有管理员才能更改设置。','The image %1$s was not copied: %2$s'=>'未复制图像 %1$s：%2$s','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'再次在“概览”中显示隐藏的建议','%d selected'=>'已选择 %d 项','Nothing matches.'=>'没有匹配项。','Select all on this page'=>'选择此页面上的所有内容','Select'=>'选择','Pages'=>'页面','Previous'=>'上一页','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'第 %1$d 页，共 %2$d 页','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'几分钟内设置好 %s','Start setup'=>'开始设置','This site'=>'本站点','Edition'=>'版本','Sites on this licence'=>'