up'=>'跳过设置','Import “%s”'=>'导入“%s”','%d page imported.'=>'已导入 %d 个页面。','edit'=>'编辑','Pages to import'=>'要导入的页面','Publish the pages now (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'现在发布页面（否则将保存为草稿）','Use the kit’s home page as the site’s front page'=>'将套件的主页设为网站首页','Create a menu with the imported pages'=>'使用导入的页面创建菜单','Importing never changes your existing pages. Importing the same kit again updates the pages it created before.'=>'导入绝不会改变您现有的页面。再次导入同一工具包会更新其以前创建的页面。','Import'=>'导入','Complete websites you can import in one click: pages, sections and a menu, ready for your own words and pictures. Kits come from Zinn Digital® and new ones are added every month.'=>'一键导入完整的网站：页面、区块和菜单，随时可以添加您自己的文字和图片。网站套件由 Zinn Digital® 提供，并且每月都会添加新套件。','Search kits'=>'搜索套件','Category'=>'分类','All categories'=>'所有分类','Free and Pro'=>'免费版和专业版','Go Pro to import'=>'升级专业版以导入','No kit matches these filters.'=>'没有符合这些筛选条件的套件。','My library'=>'我的媒体库','Team'=>'团队','Storage'=>'存储','Your library is kept in your own storage bucket, so no Zinn Digital® quota applies.'=>'您的媒体库保存在您自己的存储桶中，因此不占用 Zinn Digital® 配额。','%1$s of %2$s used (%3$d%%)'=>'已使用 %1$s / %2$s（%3$d%%）','%1$d of %2$d designs · up to %3$s per design · images are resized to 2560 px and stored once'=>'%1$d / %2$d 个设计 · 每个设计最多 %3$s · 图像将被调整为 2560 像素并仅存储一次','Deleted from your library.'=>'已从您的媒体库中删除。','Save any section or page from the editor: open the block’s ⋮ menu and choose “Save to cloud library”. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.'=>'从编辑器中保存任意分区或页面：打开区块的 ⋮ 菜单并选择“保存到云端库”。在编辑器中通过“云端库”面板，将保存的设计插入到您的任意站点中。','Show'=>'显示','Everything'=>'全部','Sections'=>'区块','Styles'=>'样式','Size'=>'大小','Nothing saved yet.'=>'尚未保存任何内容。','Delete'=>'删除','Write a test file'=>'编写测试文件','Read it back'=>'回读','Delete it'=>'删除它','In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example “my-pbs-library”). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.'=>'在您的 Cloudflare 仪表板中，打开 R2 Object Storage 并创建一个存储桶（例如“my-pbs-library”）。将其设为私有：不要连接公共域。','Open “Manage API tokens” in R2 and create an API token with “Object Read & Write” permission, limited to that one bucket.'=>'在 R2 中打开“管理 API 令牌”，创建一个具有“对象读写”权限且仅限于该存储桶的 API 令牌。','Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).'=>'复制显示的访问密钥 ID 和秘密访问密钥（该密钥仅显示一次）。','Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is “auto”.'=>'复制您账户的 S3 端点。它看起来像 https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com。区域为“auto”。','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.'=>'请粘贴以下值并保存，然后点击“测试连接”。仅在测试通过后，再将库切换至您的存储。','Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).'=>'使用您的服务提供商（Amazon S3、Backblaze B2、Wasabi、MinIO 或任何兼容 S3 的服务）创建一个私有存储桶。','Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.'=>'创建一个只能读取、写入和删除该存储桶中对象的访问密钥。','Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: https://s3.<region>.amazonaws.com) and the bucket’s region.'=>'查找 S3 终端节点（对于 Amazon S3：https://s3.<region>.amazonaws.com）及存储桶的区域。','Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off “Path-style addresses”. Most other services use path-style.'=>'Amazon S3 使用虚拟托管地址：请关闭“路径样式地址”。大多数其他服务使用路径样式。','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”.'=>'请粘贴以下数值，保存，然后点击“测试连接”。','Storage settings saved.'=>'存储设置已保存。','Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital® storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital® quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital® storage.'=>'您的云端媒体库保存在 Zinn Digital® 存储空间中，该空间包含在您的套餐内。您也可以将其保存在您自己的 Cloudflare R2 或兼容 S3 的存储桶中：这样将不再适用 Zinn Digital® 配额，并且您连接到同一存储桶的每个站点都将共享该媒体库。团队媒体库始终使用 Zinn Digital® 存储。','Connect your own storage: step by st