储桶中。','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro'=>'获取 Page Builder Sandwich Pro','Website kits'=>'网站套件','Cloud library'=>'云端库','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'由 Zinn Digital® Ltd 首席执行官 Neil Lock 构建','Version %s'=>'版本 %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Page Builder Sandwich 网站','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Zinn Digital® 网站','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'查看 Pro 方案与价格','Front-end output'=>'前端输出','Class name prefix'=>'类名前缀','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'插件在您的页面上输出的每个类名都以此前缀开头，这样页面就不会暴露是哪个插件构建的。1 到 8 个小写字母或数字，且必须以字母开头。','Beta updates'=>'Beta 更新','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'此站点接收测试版作为更新。','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'此网站仅接收稳定版本。','Change this on the Account page'=>'请在“账户”页面上更改此设置','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'测试版仅向与其账户关联的已授权 Pro 安装提供。连接后，您即可从“账户”页面加入。','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'断点已保存。页面将在下次查看时应用新的宽度。','Breakpoints'=>'断点','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'平板电脑的样式适用于平板电脑宽度以下，手机的样式适用于手机宽度以下。桌面样式适用于其他所有地方。','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'平板电脑：最大（像素）','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'移动端：最大 (px)','Save breakpoints'=>'保存断点','Use the default widths'=>'使用默认宽度','Settings'=>'设置','Templates & kits'=>'模板与工具包','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'转换此文章的请求在完成前已停止，因此该文章已被跳过。打开它以进行转换，或从此处再次转换。','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'没有可恢复的此文章备份。','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'无法保存转换后的内容。','Unknown error.'=>'未知错误。','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'尚未检查任何旧版内容。','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'正在恢复旧内容：共 %2$d 篇中的第 %1$d 篇。','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'正在转换旧内容：%1$d/%2$d 篇发布。','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'撤销完成：已恢复 %1$d 个，失败 %2$d 个。','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'转换完成：%1$d 个已转换，%2$d 个未更改，%3$d 个失败。','Legacy content'=>'旧版内容','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'使用早期版本的 Page Builder Sandwich 创建的页面会在后台转换为区块。系统会先备份每篇文章，因此每项转换都可以撤销。','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'%d 篇发布仍然包含旧版内容。','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d 篇文章已有备份。','%d post could not be handled'=>'无法处理 %d 篇文章','Post %d'=>'文章 %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'转换已开始。它将在后台继续运行，您可以离开此页面。','Convert legacy content'=>'转换旧版内容','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'要将所有已转换的文章恢复为旧版内容吗？自转换以来对这些文章所做的更改将会丢失。','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'撤销已开始。它将继续在后台运行，您可以离开此页面。','Undo all conversions'=>'撤销所有转换','Item'=>'项目','Open when the page loads'=>'页面加载时打开','Title is a heading'=>'标题即标题','Make the title a heading when the items are sections of the page, so visitors can jump between them.'=>'当标题所对应的内容为页面中的各个区块时，请将标题设为标题格式，以便访客在各区块之间跳转。','Heading %d'=>'标题 %d','Question or section title'=>'问题或栏目名称','Accordion'=>'折叠面板','Only one item open at a time'=>'每次只能打开一项','Mark up as FAQ for search engines'=>'标记为搜索引擎的常见问题解答','Adds FAQ structured data built from the titles (questions) and their text (answers).'=>'添加根据标题（问题）及其文本（答案）构建的常见问题解答结构化数据。','Alert'=>'警报','Information'=>'信息','Success'=>'成功','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'警告和错误信息会立即向屏幕阅读器用户播报，而信息和成功通知则会在他们完成当前操作后进行朗读。','Show icon'=>