where on this page'=>'链接此页面其他地方使用的术语','The first time each term appears in the page text it links to its definition. Headings, buttons, code and existing links are left alone.'=>'页面正文中每个术语首次出现时都会链接到其定义。标题、按钮、代码和现有链接保持不变。','Terms'=>'服务条款','Term %d'=>'条款 %d','Term'=>'期限','What it means…'=>'这意味着什么…','Add term'=>'添加术语','Icon list'=>'图标列表','One below the other'=>'上下排列','Side by side'=>'并排','List item…'=>'列表项…','Info box'=>'信息框','Or choose any icon from the library:'=>'或从库中选择任意图标：','Link text'=>'链接文字','Say where the link goes ("See our prices"), not "Read more".'=>'请说明链接指向何处（例如“查看我们的价格”），而不要写“了解更多”。','A sentence or two…'=>'一两句话……','section — a thematic section'=>'部分 — 主题部分','div — no meaning'=>'div — 无含义','header — introductory content'=>'页眉 — 引导内容','footer — closing content'=>'页脚 — 结束内容','article — self-contained content'=>'文章 — 独立内容','aside — related content'=>'相关内容','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'main — 主要内容（每页一次）','nav — navigation links'=>'nav — 导航链接','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'堆栈 (flexbox，纵向)','Row (flexbox)'=>'行 (flexbox)','Grid'=>'网格','Editing: %s'=>'正在编辑：%s','Lay out children as'=>'子元素布局方式为','Inherited (%s)'=>'继承自 (%s)','Flexbox'=>'弹性盒子','Stacked blocks'=>'堆叠块','Drag in the canvas, or type'=>'在画布中拖拽，或直接键入','Content width'=>'内容宽度','Boxed (the theme’s content width)'=>'盒装（主题的内容宽度）','Minimum height'=>'最小高度','HTML tag'=>'HTML 标签','Make the whole block a link to'=>'将整个区块设为链接指向','Link text for screen readers'=>'屏幕阅读器的链接文本','What the link does, for visitors who cannot see the block.'=>'链接的功能，适用于无法看到该区块的访客。','Do not put links or buttons inside a linked block: a link inside a link does not work in browsers.'=>'请勿在已链接的块中放置链接或按钮：链接内部嵌套链接在浏览器中无法正常工作。','Drag to resize these columns'=>'拖动以调整这些列的大小','Drag to resize this row'=>'拖动以调整此行的大小','Drag across cells to set how many columns and rows this block spans'=>'拖动单元格以设置此区块跨越的列数和行数','+ Column'=>'+ 列','− Column'=>'− 列','+ Row'=>'+ 行','− Row'=>'− 行','Place'=>'位置','Paste coordinates or an OpenStreetMap link'=>'粘贴坐标或 OpenStreetMap 链接','On openstreetmap.org, find the place, then copy the address from the browser bar, or right-click the map and choose "Show address".'=>'在 openstreetmap.org 上找到该地点，然后从浏览器地址栏复制网址，或者右键点击地图并选择“显示地址”。','Latitude'=>'纬度','Longitude'=>'经度','Zoom'=>'缩放','Name of the place'=>'地点名称','Shown under the map and read out by screen readers.'=>'显示在地图下方，并由屏幕阅读器读出。','Paste coordinates (for example 51.5074, -0.1278) or an OpenStreetMap link.'=>'粘贴坐标（例如 51.5074, -0.1278）或 OpenStreetMap 链接。','Coordinates or link'=>'坐标或链接','Preview the map'=>'预览地图','Check %1$s, %2$s on OpenStreetMap'=>'在 OpenStreetMap 上查看 %1$s，%2$s','Published date'=>'发布日期','Updated date (when it differs)'=>'更新日期（如有不同）','Categories'=>'类别','Tags'=>'标签','Reading time'=>'阅读时间','Comment count'=>'评论数','Details to show'=>'显示详细信息','Choose at least one detail to show.'=>'请至少选择一个要显示的详细信息。','Progress bar'=>'进度条','Maximum'=>'最大值','100 for a percentage; any other number for a count, such as 8 of 10.'=>'100 表示百分比；任何其他数字表示计数，例如 10 个中的 8 个。','Show the percentage'=>'显示百分比','A password is set. Visitors see a password form instead of this content until they enter it.'=>'已设置密码。访问者在输入密码前，看到的将是密码表单，而不是此内容。','No password is set yet, so visitors see nothing here.'=>'尚未设置密码，因此访问者在此处看不到任何内容。','New password'=>'新密码','Set the password'=>'设置密码','Password set. Save the page to apply it; visitors who had unlocked it will need the new one.'=>'密码已设置。请保存页面以生效；此前已解锁的访客将需要使用新密码。','If Page Builder Sandwich is ever switched off, this content is shown to everyone.'=>'如果 Page Builder Sandwich 被关闭，此内容将向所有人显示。','Message above the password form (optional)'=>'密码表单上方的消息（可选）','A/B test'=>'A/B 测试','Test name'=>'测试名称','Visitors who see version B (%)'=>'看到版本 B 的访客 (%)','Goal (optional)'=>'目标（可选）','A conversion is a click on a link or button, or a form sent, inside the version. To count a click elsewhere on the page instead, enter its CSS selector, for example #buy-now.'=>'转化是指版本内部对链接或按钮的点击，或是提交的表单。如需改为统计页面上其他位置的点击，请输入其 CSS 选择器，例如 #buy-now。','See the result