red)'=>'描述（必填）','What the model shows: it is what a screen reader announces.'=>'模型显示的内容：即屏幕阅读器播报的内容。','Poster image shown while it loads'=>'加载时显示的封面图片','Turn slowly on its own'=>'自行缓慢旋转','Offer "view in your space" (AR) on phones'=>'在手机上提供“实景预览”（AR）功能','Choose a 3D model in the sidebar.'=>'请在侧边栏中选择一个 3D 模型。','Choose a menu…'=>'请选择菜单…','Only people who can edit the site’s menus can choose one here.'=>'只有能够编辑网站菜单的人才能在此处进行选择。','Navigation menu'=>'导航菜单','Choose which WordPress menu to show.'=>'选择要显示的 WordPress 菜单。','This site has no menus yet. Create one, then choose it here.'=>'此网站尚无菜单。请创建一个，然后在此处进行选择。','Edit menus'=>'编辑菜单','Tells screen reader users which menu this is, for example “Main” or “Footer”.'=>'告诉屏幕阅读器用户此菜单是什么，例如“主菜单”或“页脚”。','Direction'=>'方向','In a row'=>'逐行','In a column'=>'按列','Mobile menu button'=>'移动端菜单按钮','Below this width the menu folds into a button that opens it over the page.'=>'在此宽度以下，菜单将折叠成一个按钮，点击后可在页面上方打开菜单。','On phones'=>'在手机上','On phones and tablets'=>'在手机和平板电脑上','Always'=>'始终','Never'=>'从不','Open submenus'=>'打开子菜单','When the arrow is clicked'=>'当点击箭头时','On hover, or when the arrow is clicked'=>'悬停时，或点击箭头时','Mega menus'=>'巨型菜单','A mega menu shows any blocks under a top-level item, instead of its submenu. Add a panel below the menu and choose its item.'=>'巨型菜单会显示顶级项目下的所有区块，而不是其子菜单。在菜单下方添加一个面板并选择其项目。','“%s” has a mega menu.'=>'“%s”包含一个超级菜单。','Add a mega menu panel'=>'添加超级菜单面板','Saved.'=>'已保存。','Mailchimp API key'=>'Mailchimp API 密钥','A key ending in %s is saved for the whole site.'=>'已为整个网站保存了以 %s 结尾的密钥。','No key is saved yet: the form will not appear on the page until one is.'=>'尚未保存密钥：在保存密钥之前，该表单不会显示在页面上。','New key'=>'新密钥','Save key'=>'保存密钥','Remove key'=>'移除密钥','Only an administrator can change it.'=>'只有管理员可以更改此设置。','Send signups to'=>'发送注册信息至','List ID'=>'列表 ID','MailPoet: the list number. Mailchimp: the audience ID. AWeber: the list name.'=>'MailPoet：列表编号。Mailchimp：受众 ID。AWeber：列表名称。','Wording'=>'措辞','Heading'=>'标题','Consent box'=>'同意框','Visi