在这一行中，紧邻其他内容','Automatic (own line at the top level of the page)'=>'自动（位于页面顶层的独立行）','Accessible label'=>'辅助功能标签','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'留空则为装饰图标。','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'请在区块设置中选择一个图标。','New setting name'=>'新设置名称','For example: title or text'=>'例如：标题或文本','Add setting'=>'添加设置','Widget'=>'小组件','Choose a widget'=>'选择一个小组件','Widget area'=>'小部件区域','Choose a widget area'=>'选择小组件区域','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'此图片未设置宽度和高度，因此页面在加载时会发生跳动。请从媒体库中选择，或为其设置宽度和高度。','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'此视频不来自媒体库，因此其大小未知，且页面在加载时会发生跳动。请改将其上传到媒体库。','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'此 HTML 中的图片、视频或画面缺少宽度和高度属性，导致页面在加载时会发生跳动。请为其添加宽度和高度属性。','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'此嵌入内容在加载后会自动调整大小，从而移动下方的文字。请为其留出空间或将其放置在页面的较低位置。','Layout shift'=>'布局偏移','This widget does not describe its settings, so they are edited as name and value pairs.'=>'此小部件未描述其设置，因此它们将作为名称和值对进行编辑。','Problem'=>'问题','Check'=>'检查','Show block'=>'显示区块','Use a readable theme colour'=>'使用清晰易读的主题颜色','Make it H%d'=>'将其设为 H%d','Alt text'=>'替代文本','Save alt text'=>'保存替代文本','This image is decorative'=>'此图片为装饰性图片','Checking…'=>'正在检查…','No accessibility problems found on this page.'=>'此页面未发现无障碍问题。','%1$s, %2$s.'=>'%1$s，%2$s。','%d problem'=>'%d 个问题','%d thing to check'=>'需检查的项目：%d','Check again'=>'重新检查','An automatic check finds many problems but not all of them. Also try the page with the keyboard alone and with a screen reader.'=>'自动检查只能发现许多问题，而无法发现全部问题。同时也请仅使用键盘以及屏幕阅读器对该页面进行测试。','Text contrast is %1$s:1; it needs at least %2$s:1 to be readable.'=>'文本对比度为 %1$s:1；至少需要 %2$s:1 才能保证可读性。','click here,here,read more,more,link,this link,learn more,go'=>'点击此处,此处,阅读更多,更多,链接,此链接,了解更多,前往','A link has no text, so a screen reader announces only “link”. Add text or a label.'=>'链接没有文本，因此屏幕阅读器只会播报“链接”。请添加文本或标签。','The link text “%s” does not say where it goes. Describe the destination instead.'=>'链接文本“%s”没有说明其指向何处。请改为描述目标位置。','An element has a positive tabindex, which changes the keyboard order away from the reading order. Use 0 or remove it.'=>'某个元素具有正数的 tabindex 属性，这会改变键盘导航顺序，使其与阅读顺序不一致。请使用 0 或将其移除。','Something clickable cannot be reached with the keyboard. Use a real button or link.'=>'无法使用键盘访问可点击元素。请使用真实的按钮或链接。','An embedded frame has no title, so a screen reader cannot say what it is.'=>'嵌入式框架没有标题，因此屏幕阅读器无法说明它是什么。','A form field has no label, so its purpose is not announced.'=>'表单字段缺少标签，因此无法播报其用途。','This heading is empty. Screen reader users navigate by headings; remove it or add text.'=>'此标题为空。屏幕阅读器用户通过标题进行导航；请将其删除或添加文本。','The page title is already the H1; use H2 for the top level of the content.'=>'页面标题已经是 H1，内容的第一层请使用 H2。','This H%1$d skips a level; the one before it is H%2$d. Make it an H%3$d.'=>'这个 H%1$d 跳过了一个级别；它前面的级别是 H%2$d。请将其更改为 H%3$d。','This image has no alt text. Describe it, or mark it as decorative if it adds nothing.'=>'此图片没有替代文本。请对其进行描述，如果它没有任何实际作用，则将其标记为装饰性图片。','Close panel'=>'关闭面板','Desktop'=>'桌面','Default'=>'默认','Every track'=>'每条音轨','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'轨道大小，例如：1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'自定义轨道尺寸','Equal tracks'=>'等宽轨道','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'每行一个带引号的行，例如：“head head”“side main”。为每个子块命名区域。','Automatic'=>'自动','Square (1:1)'=>'正方形 (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'标准 (4:3)','Classic (3:2)'=>'经典 (3:2)','Wide (16:9)'=>'宽屏 (16:9)','Cinema (21:9)'=>'电影 (21:9)','Tall (9:16)'=>'竖屏 (9:16)','Custom'=>'自定义','Width / height'=>'宽度 / 高度','Background image'=>'背景图片','Inherited image — replace'=>'继承的镜像 — 替换','Cover'=>'封面','Contain'=>'包含','Original size'=>'原