ideo file (MP4 / WebM)'=>'视频文件 (MP4 / WebM)','Choose MP4 or WebM video'=>'选择 MP4 或 WebM 视频','MP4 address'=>'MP4 地址','WebM address'=>'WebM 地址','YouTube video ID (11 characters)'=>'YouTube 视频 ID（11 个字符）','Vimeo video number'=>'Vimeo 视频编号','Visitors only contact the video service when they scroll to this section, and never when their device asks for reduced motion. Until then they see the poster image.'=>'访客只有在滚动到此部分时才会连接视频服务，而当其设备请求减少动态效果时则绝不会连接。在此之前，他们看到的将是海报图片。','Replace poster image'=>'替换海报图片','Choose poster image'=>'选择海报图像','Background slideshow'=>'背景幻灯片','Change images'=>'更改图像','Choose at least two images.'=>'请至少选择两张图片。','Seconds per image'=>'每张图片秒数','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'慢速缩放（肯·伯恩斯）','Remove slideshow'=>'移除幻灯片','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'设置了减少动态效果的用户只会看到第一张图片。','Section effects'=>'区段效果','Top divider'=>'顶部分割线','Bottom divider'=>'底部分隔线','Choose the logo'=>'选择标志','Not set'=>'未设置','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'检查品牌颜色：每种颜色都需要一个唯一的名称和一个有效的颜色。','Brand name'=>'品牌名称','A logo is chosen.'=>'已选择标志。','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'从网站设计页面中选择徽标。','Brand colours'=>'品牌颜色','Brand %d'=>'品牌 %d','Add brand colour'=>'添加品牌颜色','Heading font'=>'标题字体','Body font'=>'正文字体','Tone of voice'=>'语调','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'您品牌的写作风格，例如：“友好平易、短句、无行话。”人工智能在为此网站写作时将遵循此规则。','Brand kit saved.'=>'品牌工具包已保存。','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'品牌已应用：其色彩、字体和标志现已应用至该网站。','Apply to site'=>'应用到网站','All classes'=>'所有类','Class name on the page'=>'页面上的类名','Printed as %s.'=>'打印为 %s。','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'以字母开头；只能包含小写字母、数字和连字符。','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'样式控件未加载。请重新加载页面；如果问题仍然存在，请重新安装插件。','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'类已保存。所有使用它的元素都应用了新样式。','Save class'=>'保存类','Class created.'=>'已创建类。','New class'=>'新建类别','e.g. Card'=>'例如 银行卡','Create'=>'创建','Search classes'=>'搜索类','No class matches.'=>'没有匹配的类。','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'暂无类。请创建一个并为其设置样式，然后从其设置中将其添加到任何元素。','Edit %s'=>'编辑 %s','Class duplicated.'=>'已复制分类。','Delete %s'=>'删除 %s','Class deleted.'=>'已删除类别。','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'删除类“%s”？使用该类的元素将保留其内容但失去其样式。','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'只有获准添加未过滤 HTML 的用户才能更改自定义 CSS。','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'部分 CSS 将不会被使用：出于安全考虑，@import、expression()、javascript: URL、“<”和不匹配的大括号将被移除。','Upload a font'=>'上传字体','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'上传字体需要 WordPress 6.5 或更高版本。','Font name'=>'字体名称','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'例如：Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'%s 已上传并可使用。','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'选择字体文件 (%s)','Font library'=>'字体库','%d files'=>'%d 个文件','Font switched off for the site.'=>'该网站已关闭字体。','Font switched on for the site.'=>'已为该网站启用字体。','Switch off'=>'关闭','Switch on'=>'开启','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'粘贴您的 Adobe Fonts 网络项目的套件 ID。之后，该项目的字体将从 Adobe 加载到您的网页上。','Your web projects'=>'您的网络项目','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'Adobe Fonts 已连接。','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'Adobe Fonts 已断开连接。','Kit id'=>'工具包编号','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'“%s”的暗色值不是有效的颜色。','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'当访客未选择时','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'跟随访客的设备','Dark colours'=>'深色','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'为每种颜色设置对应的深色版本。留空的颜色在两种主题下保持不变。只要有一种颜色设置了深色值，深色模式就会立即开启。','Dark version of %s'=>'%s的暗色版本','Dark mode saved.'=>'深色模式已保存。','Page CSS'=>'页面 CSS','Global classes'=>'全局类','Classes'=>'类别','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'请先在“网站设计”中创建类，然后再将其添加到此处。','Custom CSS'=>'自定义 CSS','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'为该元素编写规则。“selector”表示该元素，例如 selector:hover { opacity: .8 } —— 纯声明应用于元素本身。','Font files must be %s.'=>'字体文件必须是 %s。','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'该字体文件为空或大于 10 MB。','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'一次设置，随处复用，集中修改。','Variables'=>'变量','Named values any element can use.'=>'任何元素都可以使用的命名值。','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'间距、圆角与阴影','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'每个间距、圆角和阴影拾取器所提供的缩放比例。','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'为您希望深色模式的访客提供的一套深色配色方案。','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'AI和模板使用的徽标、颜色、字体和语调。','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'上传您自己的字体或连接 Adobe Fonts。','CSS for this page only.'=>'仅限本页的 CSS。','CSS for this page'=>'此页面的 CSS','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'仅在此页面上加载，在网站样式之后。随页面保存。','Short name'=>'简短名称','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'短名称 "%s" 被使用了两次。','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s"：简短名称只能使用小写字母、数字和连字符。','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'"%s" 的值不是此设置所接受的值。','Radius'=>'半径','Add a step'=>'添加步骤','Scales saved.'=>'已保存缩放比例。','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'缩放已重置为默认值。','Reset to the default scales'=>'重置为默认比例','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'暂无变量。变量持有一个值（如宽度、颜色混合、字体大小），供多个元素共享。','Add variable'=>'添加变量','Variables saved.'=>'变量已保存。','Entrance animation'=>'进场动画','Fade in'=>'渐显','Fade in, rising'=>'渐显上浮','Fade in, dropping'=>'淡入，下落','Fade in from the start side'=>'从起始侧淡入','Fade in from the end side'=>'从末端淡入','Zoom out'=>'缩小','Flip up'=>'向上翻转','Animation length (ms)'=>'动画时长 (ms)','Animation delay (ms)'=>'动画延迟 (ms)','While scrolling'=>'滚动时','Fade in as it scrolls into view'=>'滚动进入视图时淡入','Rise as it scrolls into view'=>'滚动至可视区域时浮现','Grow as it scrolls into view'=>'滚动至视口时放大显示','Straighten as it scrolls into view'=>'滚动至可视区域时拉直','On hover'=>'悬停时','Lift'=>'升级','Glow'=>'光泽','Stay in view (px from the top)'=>'保持视线（距离顶部像素）','Parallax speed (-10 to 10)'=>'视差速度 (-10 到 10)','Follow the pointer (strength)'=>'跟随指针（强度）','Place ID'=>'位置标识符','Find it with Google’s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.'=>'使用 Google 的 Place ID 查找工具找到它：搜索您的企业并复制 ID。','An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.'=>'来自您的 Google Cloud 项目的 API 密钥，且该项目已启用 Places API (New)。将其限制为仅使用该 API。','Business unit ID'=>'业务单元 ID','The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations › API).'=>'您在 Trustpilot 上的企业的 24 个字符 ID，来自您的 Trustpilot Business 帐户（Integrations › API）。','The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'您 Trustpilot Business 账户的 API 密钥。','Not set up.'=>'未设置。','The saved key can no longer be read (the site’s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'保存的密钥已无法读取（网站的安全密钥已更改）。请重新输入。','Needs both an ID and an API key.'=>'需要同时提供 ID 和 API 密钥。','Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google’s terms do not allow keeping them).'=>'设置。每次查看包含“评论”区块的页面时，都会实时加载 Google 评论：每次查看时在您自己的密钥上发出一个“地点详情”请求，且绝不存储（Google 的条款不允许保留这些评论）。','The first refresh failed: %s'=>'第一次刷新失败：%s','Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).'=>'等待首次刷新（大约一两分钟内）。','Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.'=>'已刷新 %1$s：保留 %2$d 条评价，评分 %3$s（共 %4$d 条）。','The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s'=>'最后一次尝试（%1$s）失败，以上评论已保留：%2$s','Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.'=>'已保存。Trustpilot 评论将在后台的一两分钟内获取；Google 评论则会在页面上实时加载。','Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.'=>'Trustpilot 评论每天在后台获取一次并保留在您的网站上，因此繁忙的页面不会在您的 Trustpilot 账户上产生额外费用；如果刷新失败，则保留最近的评论。Google 不允许存储其评论，因此当访问者查看页面时会实时加载：每次查看都是对您自己的 Google 密钥的一个请求，由 Google 收费。','Where to find it'=>'在哪裡找到','Saved (…%s). Type a new one to replace it.'=>'已保存（…%s）。输入新内容以将其替换。','Remove the %s details and its reviews'=>'删除 %s 的详细信息及其评价','Refreshed.'=>'已刷新。','Refresh now'=>'立即刷新','Next daily refresh: %s.'=>'下次每日刷新：%s。','Your Google and Trustpilot details, for the Reviews block.'=>'用于“评价”区块的您的 Google 和 Trustpilot 详细信息。','No colours yet.'=>'暂无颜色。','Colour %d'=>'颜色 %d','Add colour'=>'添加颜色','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'两种颜色同名。请重命名其中一个。','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" 不是一个有效的颜色。','Theme colours'=>'主题颜色','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'您主题调色板。此处所做的更改将保存为您的网站版本的颜色（与“站点编辑器”保存的方式相同），并应用于使用该颜色的所有地方。','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'主题颜色已恢复为主题自身的默认值。','Reset theme colours'=>'重置主题颜色','Your colours'=>'您的颜色','Colours saved.'=>'颜色已保存。','Pick a colour for %s'=>'为 %s 选择一种颜色','Clear'=>'清除','The change could not be saved.'=>'无法保存更改。','Theme default'=>'主题默认值','Theme fonts'=>'主题字体','Your fonts'=>'您的字体','Font stack'=>'字体栈','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'已上传的字体：其文件来自字体库。','System sans-serif'=>'系统无衬线字体','Add font stack'=>'添加字体堆栈','Fonts saved.'=>'字体已保存。','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'与您的主题和网站编辑器共享。','Fonts'=>'字体','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'全站的标题与正文字体。','Back to Site design'=>'返回站点设计','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'专业版提供类名、令牌、暗黑模式、品牌工具包和自定义字体','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'打开“网站编辑器”的样式','A heading with a tighter line height, styled with the Style tab.'=>'带有更紧凑行高的标题，使用“样式”标签进行设计。','A paragraph of text, styled with the Style tab.'=>'段落文本，使用“样式”选项卡进行设置。','An image with rounded corners, styled with the Style tab.'=>'使用“样式”标签页设置圆角样式的图片。','A video from the Media Library, styled with the Style tab.'=>'来自媒体库的视频，使用“样式”选项卡进行设置。','Spacer'=>'间隔符','Empty space between blocks; set a different height per screen size in the Style tab.'=>'块之间的空白处；请在“样式”选项卡中针对不同的屏幕尺寸设置不同的高度。','Divider'=>'分割线','A horizontal line between sections, styled with the Style tab.'=>'使用“样式”选项卡设置样式的区段之间的水平线。','Content from another site (a video, a post, a map) by pasting its address.'=>'通过粘贴其他网站（视频、帖子、地图）的地址来引入其内容。','Several images in a grid, styled with the Style tab.'=>'网格中的多张图片，使用“样式”选项卡进行样式设计。','Plain'=>'纯文本','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'没有可切换的语言。当翻译插件列出两种或更多语言时，此切换器才会显示。','Switcher'=>'切换器','Show the current language'=>'显示当前语言','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'安装 Tranzly 并添加两种或更多语言，切换器将显示在此处。','Pills'=>'胶囊标签','Dropdown'=>'下拉菜单','Language codes'=>'语言代码','Show each language as'=>'显示每种语言为','Language name'=>'语言名称','Language code'=>'语言代码','Name and code'=>'名称和代码','Flags'=>'标记','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'默认关闭：旗帜代表国家，而非语言。','Include the current language'=>'包含当前语言','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'隐藏未翻译此页面的语言','Stack vertically'=>'垂直堆叠','Current language text'=>'当前语言文本','Current language background'=>'当前语言背景','Size and spacing'=>'大小和间距','Space between languages'=>'语言间的空间','Text size'=>'文本大小','Connected (key %s).'=>'已连接（密钥 %s）。','API URL'=>'API URL','Replace the API key'=>'替换 API 密钥','Where to find your %s API key'=>'在哪里找到您的 %s API 密钥','Check and save'=>'检查并保存','Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block\'s settings → After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.'=>'连接一次邮件列表服务；之后，任何表单都可以将填写表单的人员添加到你的某个列表中（表单区块的设置 → 发送后）。系统会对密钥与该服务进行验证，加密存储在本网站上，并且绝不会再次显示。','Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a "Conversion event" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.'=>'无需代码，即可将表单提交和按钮点击发送到您的分析工具中。将 ID 留空即可跳过该服务。按钮的高级面板中将包含“转化事件”字段。开启 Cookie 横幅后，在访客同意之前不会加载任何内容。','Google Analytics 4 measurement ID'=>'Google Analytics 4 衡量 ID','Google Tag Manager container ID'=>'Google Tag Manager 容器 ID','Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)'=>'Meta 像素 ID（Meta 事件管理器中显示的数字）','Load these tags on my site'=>'在我的网站上加载这些标签','Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.'=>'如果您的主题或其他插件已经添加了这些内容，请将其关闭；事件仍会发送。','Event name for form submissions'=>'表单提交的事件名称','The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for "save"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays "denied", and the scripts you list stay switched off.'=>'横幅是一个您使用区块设计的弹出窗口。其按钮链接到 #consent-accept、#consent-reject 和 #consent-save（其中用于“保存”的复选框命名为 analytics 和 marketing）；在任何地方链接到 #consent-open 都可以再次显示它。在访客接受之前，跟踪代码不会加载，Google Consent Mode 保持“denied”（拒绝），并且您列出的脚本保持关闭状态。','Create a ready-made banner'=>'创建现成横幅','Show a cookie banner'=>'显示 Cookie 横幅','Banner'=>'横幅','Choose a popup…'=>'选择一个弹出窗口……','%s (draft)'=>'%s (草稿)','Edit the banner'=>'编辑横幅','Remember the choice for (days)'=>'记住此选择的时间（天）','Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no'=>'欧洲联盟、欧洲经济区和英国以外：加载跟踪，直至访问者拒绝为止','Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor\'s country (for example Cloudflare\'s CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.'=>'关闭：每位访客都必须先同意（最严格的规则，也是默认设置）。开启：仅当您的主机或 CDN 报告访客所在国家/地区（例如 Cloudflare 的 CF-IPCountry 请求头），且该国家/地区属于 EU、EEA、英国和瑞士境外时生效。横幅仍会显示，未知国家/地区将被视为属于 EU 境内。','Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)'=>'其他在获得同意前暂缓执行的脚本（标识符：analytics 或标识符：marketing，以英文逗号分隔）','Popups, slide-ins and bars'=>'弹出窗口、滑入窗口和横幅','A/B test results'=>'A/B 测试结果','Mailing-list connections'=>'邮件列表连接','Popup settings'=>'弹出窗口设置','Popup (in the middle, page dimmed)'=>'弹出窗口（居中，页面变暗）','Slide-in (in a corner)'=>'侧边栏（角部）','Bar (top or bottom)'=>'栏（顶部或底部）','Bottom, end side'=>'底部，末端侧','Bottom, start side'=>'底部，起始侧','When the page loads'=>'当页面加载时','After a delay'=>'延迟后','After scrolling part of the page'=>'滚动页面一部分后','When the visitor is about to leave'=>'当访客即将离开时','When something is clicked'=>'点击时','Percent of the page'=>'页面百分比','CSS selector of the element'=>'元素的 CSS 选择器','How often'=>'多久一次','Every page view'=>'每次页面浏览','Once per visit'=>'每次访问一次','Once every few days'=>'每几天一次','Until the visitor converts'=>'直到访客转化','Every page'=>'每页','The front page'=>'首页','Chosen pages (IDs)'=>'已选页面 (ID)','Chosen content types'=>'已选内容类型','Page IDs, comma separated'=>'页面ID，以逗号分隔','Content types, comma separated (post, page, product)'=>'内容类型，以逗号分隔 (post, page, product)','Devices'=>'设备','Desktop only'=>'仅限桌面端','Mobile only'=>'仅限移动端','Close when the dimmed page is clicked'=>'点击变暗的页面时关闭','Link a button to #popup-close to close the popup, or to #popup-convert to count a conversion.'=>'将按钮链接到 #popup-close 以关闭弹出窗口，或链接到 #popup-convert 以计