ormal'=>'站点恢复正常','Maintenance: a notice, and search engines are told to come back later'=>'维护：发布通知并指示搜索引擎稍后访问','Pre-launch: a notice, and search engines are told not to index the site'=>'预发布：一条通知，并告知搜索引擎不要索引该网站','Page to show instead'=>'显示为此页面','Design any page with the builder and choose it here. Without one, visitors see a short notice with the site’s name.'=>'使用构建器设计任意页面并在此处选择。如果没有此页面，访问者将看到一条包含网站名称的简短通知。','Who still sees the real site (administrators always do):'=>'谁仍能看到真实网站（管理员总是可以看到）：','Open the site in a private window to see what visitors see.'=>'在无痕窗口中打开网站，查看访客看到的页面。','Network settings saved.'=>'网络设置已保存。','These settings apply to the %d site in this network.'=>'这些设置适用于此网络中的 %d 个网站。','Shared templates'=>'共享模板','Patterns saved on the main site that are ticked here appear on every site, under “Network templates”. Each site inserts its own copy.'=>'在主站上保存并在此处勾选的图案将显示在每个站点的“网络模板”下方。每个站点都会插入其自己的副本。','The main site has no saved patterns yet.'=>'主站点尚无已保存的图案。','White label for every site'=>'每个网站均可使用白标','Used by every site that has not saved its own white-label settings.'=>'由每个未保存其自有白标设置的网站使用。','Turn white label on'=>'启用白标','Builder name'=>'生成器名称','Visual editor name'=>'可视化编辑器名称','Author website'=>'作者网站','Menu icon'=>'菜单图标','Role defaults for every site'=>'每个网站的角色默认设置','Save network settings'=>'保存网络设置','Searching… %d item checked so far.'=>'正在搜索… 目前已检查 %d 个项目。','No matches in %d items. Nothing to replace.'=>'在 %d 个项目中没有找到匹配项。无可替换的内容。','%1$d matches on %2$d pages (%3$d items searched). Nothing has changed yet.'=>'在 %2$d 个页面上找到 %1$d 个匹配项（已搜索 %3$d 个项目）。目前没有任何更改。','Replacing… %1$d of %2$d pages done.'=>'正在替换……已完成 %1$d/%2$d 页。','Done: %d page changed. You can undo this.'=>'已完成：%d 个页面已更改。您可以撤销此操作。','Undoing…'=>'正在撤销…','Undone: %1$d pages restored. %2$d pages were edited after the replacement and were left as they are.'=>'撤销：已恢复 %1$d 个页面。%2$d 个页面在替换后经过了编辑，保持原样未变。','Undone: %d page restored.'=>'已撤销：已恢复 %d 个页面。','Replace'=>'替换','Find'=>'查找','A hex colour such as #1a73e8. Short forms (#fff) match too.'=>'诸如 #1a73e8 的十六进制颜色代码。也支持简写形式（#fff）。','Replace with'=>'替换为','Match upper and lower case'=>'区分大小写','Find matches'=>'查找匹配项','Matches'=>'匹配项','Replace on %d page'=>'在 %d 页上替换','Undo this replacement'=>'撤销此替换','Review comments'=>'查看评论','Add a comment'=>'添加评论','Comment %1$d by %2$s: %3$s'=>'%2$s 的评论 %1$d：%3$s','%d comments on this page.'=>'此页面上有 %d 条评论。','Your comment'=>'您的评论','Send comment'=>'发送评论','Thank you, your comment was sent.'=>'谢谢，您的评论已发送。','Click the part of the page your comment is about.'=>'点击您评论对应的页面部分。','Client review'=>'客户评审','That part of the page could not be found: it may have been changed or removed since the comment was made.'=>'找不到页面的该部分：自发表评论以来，它可能已被更改或删除。','Review link'=>'审查链接','Let a client comment on this page'=>'允许客户在此页面上发表评论','Anyone with the link can see this page, even before it is published, and leave comments. No account is needed.'=>'任何拥有链接的人都可以查看此页面（甚至在发布之前）并发表评论。无需注册账号。','Make a new link (the old one stops working)'=>'生成新链接（旧链接将失效）','Comments (%d open)'=>'评论（%d 个未处理）','Show resolved comments'=>'显示已解决的评论','No comments to show.'=>'暂无评论。','Reply'=>'回复','Send reply'=>'发送回复','Show in the editor'=>'在编辑器中显示','Resolve'=>'解决','Reopen'=>'重新打开','Open Sandwich Studio'=>'打开 Sandwich Studio','Change styles'=>'更改样式','Custom CSS and HTML'=>'自定义 CSS 和 HTML','Manage templates'=>'管理模板','Use AI'=>'使用人工智能','Client mode: text and images only'=>'客户端模式：仅限文本和图像','Role settings saved.'=>'角色设置已保存。','Roles and client mode'=>'角色和客户模式','Choose what each role can do in the builder. Administrators can always do everything. Client mode locks the layout and design, so the role can only change text and images.'=>'选择每个角色在构建器中可以执行的操作。管理员始终可以执行所有操作。客户端模式会锁定布局和设计，因此该角色只能更改文本和图像。','Save role settings'=>'保存角色设置','Saved. Reload the page to see the new names.'=>'已保存。请重新加载页面以查看新名称。','Rename the builder and hide our branding on this site'=>'重命名建站工具并在此网站上隐藏我们的品牌','Shown everywhere the product name appears: menus, the editor, notices.'=>'显示在出现产品名称的所有位置：菜单、